    "chunk_size_bytes": 812,
    "chunk_text": "The program continued on 11 and 12 August with engagements involving the World Trade Centre Mumbai, All India Association of Industries, International Chamber of Investment and Business (ICIB) and Mahratta Chamber of Commerce, Industries & Agriculture in Pune.\n\nThe EDB is also using the India initiative to build international participation for Sri Lanka Expo 2027, scheduled for 14\u201317 January 2027 at BMICH in Colombo. Indian and other international buyers are being encouraged to attend, while companies specialising in advanced technologies, machinery and other export-related capabilities are being invited to exhibit.\n\nThe India delegation forms part of the EDB\u2019s broader strategy to expand international market opportunities for Sri Lankan exporters and generate momentum ahead of Sri Lanka Expo 2027."
  },
