    "chunk_text": "Following the presentation of an independent Investment Climate Assessment, the Dialogue focused on Sri Lanka\u2019s strategic choice on foreign investment; translating that vision into implementation through regulatory reform; and identifying opportunities to build a deeper European\u2013Sri Lanka investment partnership.\n\nParticipants included the Chairman of the Board of Investment of Sri Lanka; Deputy Ministers representing Finance, Foreign Affairs, Industries and other relevant ministries; the Ambassador of the European Union to Sri Lanka and the Maldives; the Ambassadors of France, Germany, Italy and the Netherlands; representatives of EU Member States\u2019 missions; and senior officials from the Presidential Secretariat, the Finance Ministry, the Foreign Affairs Ministry and the Board of Investment."
