    "md5": "822adf6d717d23acb22720d327bac6bc",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1618,
    "chunk_text": "Hilton Colombo brings flavours of Vi\u1ec7t  Nam to Graze Kitchen\n\nThis August, Hilton Colombo presents the second edition of its widely popular \u2018Flavors of Vi\u1ec7t Nam,\u2019 a 10-day culinary showcase that will celebrate the vibrant gastronomic traditions of Vi\u1ec7t Nam.\n\nTaking place from 20 \u2013 29 August in collaboration with Hilton Saigon, this immersive gourmet experience will encompass authentic Vietnamese recipes, live cooking stations, and regional specialties served alongside Graze Kitchen\u2019s signature dinner buffet.\n\nLed by guest chefs Nam and Van from Hilton Saigon, the event takes diners on a nightly journey through Vietnam\u2019s diverse culinary regions, with dishes shaped by traditional techniques and bold, balanced flavours.\n\nThe showcase will feature B\u00e1nh M\u00ec, layered with crisp pickled vegetables, fresh basil and coriander; steaming bowls of Vietnamese Pho, served with beef or chicken and accompanied by fresh herbs among other authentic dishes. Guests can also indulge in B\u00e1nh X\u00e8o, a Vietnamese pancake, along with delicate fresh spring rolls and charcoal-grilled specialties. Traditional favorites such as fragrant Vietnamese coffee jelly and mango sticky rice bring a distinctly Vietnamese touch to the dessert selection.\n\nCommenting on the collaboration, Manesh Fernando, General Manager of Hilton Colombo said, \u201cFood has a unique way of bringing cultures together. Through our collaboration with Hilton Saigon, we are honored to share the flavors and traditions of Vi\u1ec7t Nam with our guests, bringing a taste of this remarkable culinary destination to Colombo for the second time.\u201d"
  },
