    "chunk_text": "12-year-old boy dies after falling from Colombo apartment building\n\nColombo, Aug. 17 (Daily Mirror) - A 12-year-old boy has died after falling from an apartment building in the Colombo 09 area, police said.\n\nAccording to initial investigations, the child had been sightseeing with several other children near a swimming pool located on an upper floor of the 14-storey apartment building where he lived.\n\nThe boy reportedly fell from the building to the ground, resulting in his death."
