    "chunk_text": "Special information system launched for 2026 Kandy Esala Perahera\n\nColombo, Aug. 17 (Daily Mirror) - The Sri Lanka Police has introduced a special information management system to help the public easily access essential information during the 2026 Kandy Esala Perahera.\n\nThe annual Kandy Esala Perahera will commence on August 18 and continue until August 28, with special security and traffic arrangements in place throughout the festival.\n\nPolice said the special programme includes roadblocks, security duties, vehicle and person checks, tourist assistance and vehicle parking arrangements.\n\nThrough the newly introduced information system, the public will be able to obtain live information on several key facilities and arrangements during the Perahera, including:\n\nThe system can be accessed through the official Sri Lanka Police website, www.police.lk, by selecting the \u201cKandy Esala Perahera\u201d link.\n\nPolice said the initiative is aimed at making it easier and safer for both local and foreign visitors to obtain information while attending the historic procession."
