    "language": "en",
    "md5": "22eb733ad6d24be0d5fb27ad0da4d399",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1832,
    "chunk_text": "HNB Finance appoints new Non-Independent Non-Executive Directors\n\nHNB Finance PLC announced the appointments of Sivarajah Nandakumar and Ponnehennedige Thumudu Supun Dias as Non-Independent Non-Executive Directors of the company.\n\nNandakumar holds a Master of Business Administration from the Postgraduate Institute of Management, University of Sri Jayewardenepura and is an Associate Member of the Institute of Bankers of Sri Lanka in Banking and Finance.\n\nNandakumar currently serves as Executive Vice President and Chief Business Operations Officer of Hatton National Bank PLC, where he provides overall leadership, strategic direction and oversight of the bank\u2019s operational functions, including centralised operations and shared services.\n\nHe also serves as a Non-Independent Non-Executive Director of Lanka Financial Services Bureau Limited, providing strategic governance oversight and is an active member of its Board Audit Committee.\n\nWith more than 34 years of distinguished service at Hatton National Bank, Nandakumar has held several senior management and corporate leadership positions across branch banking, operations management, regional leadership, private banking and business development. Throughout his career, he has contributed significantly to the bank\u2019s growth, operational excellence, customer outreach and business expansion initiatives.\n\nDias holds a Postgraduate Diploma in Marketing from The Chartered Institute of Marketing, UK. He is also a Chartered Marketer of The Chartered Institute of Marketing, UK and an Ordinary Life Member of the Sri Lanka Institute of Marketing.\n\nDias currently serves as Executive Vice President and Head of Network Business at Hatton National Bank, where he provides strategic leadership and overall direction for the bank\u2019s branch network and distribution channels."
  },
