    "description": "Minister pledges to build Australia-like Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Minister-pledges-to-build-Australia-like-Sri-Lanka/273-348305",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
