    "chunk_text": "He invited the Australian investors and entrepreneurs to participate in Sri Lanka\u2019s economic transformation, stressing that investment opportunities were available across sectors and at different scales.\n\nAustralian Federal Parliamentarian Cassandra Fernando, Sri Lankan Consul General in Melbourne Pradeepa Seram, Sri Lanka Export Development Board Chairman Mangala Wijesinghe and Board of Investment of Sri Lanka Director General Dr. Sulakshana Jayawardena were among those present.\n\nNPP Australia organiser Pubudu Samaraweera, Australian state and territory parliamentarians and leading business representatives from both countries also attended the conference, which focused on strengthening trade, investment and economic relations between Sri Lanka and Australia."
