    "description": "\u2018Between the Lamp and the Pot:\u2019 A referendum remembered, and a warning for today",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Between-the-Lamp-and-the-Pot-A-referendum-remembered-and-a-warning-for-today/172-348324",
