    "chunk_text": "Such caution he exercised in the friendships he cultivated and this is one reason why I feel privileged to have earned his trust. He stood by me through all the storms that came my way. He would criticise me and then laugh about it.\n\nI missed my daughter\u2019s call, but she took the trouble to send me a voice message. She knows how much her \u2018Uncle Harry\u2019 meant to her father. She knew I was grateful. She knew that I would feel bad had I failed to remember his birthday. She knows me. She also knew Harry Jayawardena or rather a side of the man that not too many people have seen: a staunchly loyal friend who valued gratitude and attitude and who, in personifying such qualities, inscribed them on his friends. And their children.\n\nI am proud that my children understand the true meaning of gratitude. They know that Harry J stood by me at one of the most crucial times in my life, and they have never forgotten it. That voice message made me remember all the good times, the laughter, the banter and respect come back to me. So too the immense void."
