    "chunk_size_bytes": 484,
    "chunk_text": "Ven. Rambukana Siddhartha Thero passes away\n\nColombo, Aug. 18 (Daily Mirror) - Veteran Buddhist monk, renowned lyricist and author Ven. Rambukana Siddhartha Thero has passed away at the age of 76.\n\nHe died while undergoing treatment at a hospital, where he had been admitted following an illness.\n\nSiddhartha Thero made a notable contribution to Sri Lanka\u2019s music and literary fields, writing lyrics for numerous popular songs that gained widespread appreciation among music lovers."
