    "description": "Six chairpersons for tourism in eight years: What does that tell us about Sri Lankan tourism?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Six-chairpersons-for-tourism-in-eight-years-What-does-that-tell-us-about-Sri-Lankan-tourism/4-796206",
    "lang": "en",
