    "description": "ADB, Government advance SUWERP to protect Sri Lanka\u2019s upper watersheds",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/ADB-Government-advance-SUWERP-to-protect-Sri-Lanka-s-upper-watersheds/56-796226",
