    "chunk_text": "The visit also highlighted the value placed on building lasting connections between Sri Lanka and Korea through trusted partnerships and the presence of internationally respected Korean brands in the Sri Lankan market.\n\nThe continued collaboration between Hyundai and Abans Auto reflects this relationship, with Abans Auto bringing Hyundai\u2019s global range closer to Sri Lankan consumers.\n\nThe Hyundai flagship store showcases Hyundai\u2019s latest vehicles to customers across Sri Lanka.\n\nThe Abans group, founded in 1968, brings over five decades of legacy to this partnership. Today, it stands as a diversified conglomerate with a workforce exceeding 10,000 employees and a network of over 400 touchpoints across Sri Lanka. Its operations span retail, services, logistics, manufacturing, real estate and infrastructure services, consistently driven by its mission to empower a \u2018Better Way to Life\u2019."
