    "chunk_text": "Sri Lankan refugees in India allowed to return: Minister\n\nColombo, Aug. 19 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0The Cabinet has decided to allow Sri Lankan\u00a0 refugees to be domiciled in India to return to the island without any obstacles, Minister of Public Security Ananda Wijepala told Parliament today."
