    "md5": "e2495e3cb25958059e8b5561c9e3dc75",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1654,
    "chunk_text": "HNB Life among Best Workplaces for 4th time\n\nHNB Life PLC has been recognised by Great Place to Work Sri Lanka as one of the Top 50 Best Workplaces in Sri Lanka, further strengthening its reputation as an organisation that places its people at the heart of its success.\n\nThis marks the fourth time the company has received this prestigious recognition, reaffirming its continued commitment to building a workplace culture founded on trust, inclusivity, collaboration and growth.\n\nThe recognition is based on comprehensive feedback from the employees and an independent assessment of the company\u2019s workplace culture, leadership practices and initiatives aimed at creating a positive and supportive environment for its people.\n\nHNB Life Executive Director and CEO Lasitha Wimalaratne stated, \u201cBeing recognised as one of Sri Lanka\u2019s Best Workplaces for the fourth time is a proud milestone for HNB Life. This recognition reflects the culture we have built together over the years and most importantly, the trust and confidence our people place in the organisation. As we celebrate our 25-year journey and step into a new chapter as HNB Life, we remain committed to creating a workplace where every employee feels valued, empowered and inspired to grow.\u201d\n\nOver the years, HNB Life has continued to strengthen its people-focused culture through initiatives centred around employee engagement, leadership development, diversity and inclusion, learning and career advancement. The company believes that nurturing a workplace where the employees can thrive is fundamental to delivering exceptional value to the customers and achieving sustainable growth."
