    "chunk_size_bytes": 435,
    "chunk_text": "Former Minister Jagath Pushpakumara\u2019s wife passes away\n\nColombo, Aug. 19 (Daily Mirror) - The wife of former Cabinet Minister and Monaragala District MP Jagath Pushpakumara has passed away following an accident.\n\nShe reportedly fell from the second floor of a newly constructed building belonging to the family.\n\nShe was admitted to Karapitiya Teaching Hospital for treatment following the incident but passed away this morning (19)."
