    "description": "NMSJ urges lawmakers to avoid SC \u2018hearing its own case\u2019",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/NMSJ-urges-lawmakers-to-avoid-SC-hearing-its-own-case/56-796248",
