    "description": "Sri Lanka\u2019s $ 5 b IT Industry Strategic Roadmap and the English Language blindspot",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Sri-Lanka-s-5-b-IT-Industry-Strategic-Roadmap-and-the-English-Language-blindspot/4-796249",
