    "chunk_text": "The ASUS ExpertBook Ultra is ultra-portable flagship meticulously crafted from AZ31B magnesium-aluminum alloy, a material typically reserved for Aerospace and Formula 1 applications, with a Nano Ceramic surface with a 9H hardness rating. It is engineered to deliver an unprecedented balance of performance, durability, aesthetics, and user experience.\n\nThe ExpertBook Ultra also delivers an exceptional visual and audio experience. The 14-inch 3K 120Hz anti-glare touchscreen Tandem OLED display reaches up to 1,400 nits of brightness, producing stunning lifelike visuals and vibrant colours while consuming significantly less power than conventional OLED panels. Paired with a six-speaker Dolby Atmos audio system, the laptop offers immersive sound with crystal-clear voice quality for virtual meetings, presentations, and executive workflows.\n\nProductivity is further augmented through a suite of AI-powered capabilities that simplify collaboration, improve communication and enable professionals to make the most of AI-assisted workflows. These include ASUS ExpertMeet, AI noise cancellation, intelligent camera enhancements, and support for next-generation AI experiences via ASUS MyExpert. Designed for professionals on the move, it combines all-day battery life, fast charging, Wi-Fi 7, and a full-range of business-ready physical ports, allowing users to remain productive without relying on additional adapters or accessories. Enterprise-grade security sits at the core with ASUS ExpertGuardian, providing biometric authentication, Microsoft Pluton integration, and hardware-level BIOS protection.\n\nComplementing this flagship is the significantly expanded ExpertBook B and P series, featuring the ExpertBook P5, B5, P3 and B3 models tailored for organisations of all sizes. To provide ultimate power of choice for IT decision-makers, these models offer multiple chassis options in 14-inch and 16-inch display configurations."
