    "chunk_text": "Complementing this flagship is the significantly expanded ExpertBook B and P series, featuring the ExpertBook P5, B5, P3 and B3 models tailored for organisations of all sizes. To provide ultimate power of choice for IT decision-makers, these models offer multiple chassis options in 14-inch and 16-inch display configurations.\n\nTo provide the ultimate power of choice for IT decision-makers, these new ExpertBook models include multiple chassis options with 14-inch and 16-inch display configurations. These versatile AI powerhouses offer a wide range of processing options up to Intel Core Ultra Series 3 processor, incredibly powerful GPU and advanced NPU (50 TOPS), along with massive scalability with up to 64GB DDR5 RAM and Dual SSD support for storage.\n\nASUS APAC Head of Commercial PCs Rex Lee said: \u201cAt ASUS, our innovation is rooted in Design Thinking, i.e. Listening closely to modern professionals to solve real-world industry gaps. We recognised that business leaders were constantly forced to choose between ultra-light portability, sustained performance, and long battery life. With meaningful insights like this, we created the ExpertBook Ultra to eliminate that compromise entirely, setting a new benchmark for C-suite executives.\u201d\n\n\u201cSri Lanka accelerates into an AI-first era, we are proud to deliver a complete \u2018Power of Choice\u2019 across our new lineup powered by Intel Core Ultra Series 3 processors. From our flagship Ultra to the versatile ExpertBook B and P Series, we aim to empower Sri Lankan organisations with high-performance NPUs delivering up to 50 TOPS for seamless, secure, on-device AI collaboration. Above all, this entire lineup is anchored by our \u2018Worry-Free Business\u2019 promise, combining military-grade durability, enterprise security, and Sri Lanka\u2019s most comprehensive local support ecosystem so businesses can scale with absolute confidence.\u201d"
