    "description": "Lakshan Madurasinghe becomes Sri Lanka\u2019s first certified WHY Coach by Simon Sinek\u2019s Why School",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Lakshan-Madurasinghe-becomes-Sri-Lanka-s-first-certified-WHY-Coach-by-Simon-Sinek-s-Why-School/34-796263",
