    "description": "Sri Lankan printer Sathis Abeywickrama recognised as a \u2018Flexo Avenger\u2019  at Flexo Summit Asia 2026",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Sri-Lankan-printer-Sathis-Abeywickrama-recognised-as-a-Flexo-Avenger-at-Flexo-Summit-Asia-2026/34-796274",
