    "chunk_size_bytes": 1213,
    "chunk_text": "The campaign is also engineered to future-proof Sri Lanka\u2019s search presence as travelers increasingly rely on artificial intelligence assistants, generative chatbots, and short-form video algorithms to plan travel. Hewawasam explained that destination data and regional itineraries are being optimized so that AI platforms accurately index Sri Lanka\u2019s offerings.\n\nPerhaps the most significant strategic evolution articulated at the launch is the expansion of the destination brand into a unified nation brand architecture. For decades, Sri Lanka\u2019s international promotion operated in institutional silos, with tourism, the Sri Lanka Tea Board, the Export Development Board, the Board of Investment, and Sri Lanka Cricket marketing the country independently. The new promotional framework brings these entities together under one national story, aligning tourism, tea, trade, investment, culture, and sports into a single brand identity.\n\nAs Hewawasam concluded, \u201cThe destination brand might be the key nation branding thing in the country. Nation branding is how Sri Lanka positions itself to the world by connecting its distinctive assets, sectors, and institutions into one compelling national story.\u201d"
