    "chunk_text": "The promotion brings together an extensive portfolio of merchant including leading apparel and fashion brands such as Cool Planet, Hameedia, Signature, Envoy Mansion, Crocodile, SWX, Avirate, Jezza, TFS, Stripes and Checks, Be Desi and The Factory Outlet; family, children\u2019s and household retailers including The Kids Warehouse, House of Gifts and Elegant Charms; popular dining and culinary destinations such as Sheraton Colombo, Courtyard by Marriott, Mandarina Colombo, Arabian Knights, Indian Summer Restaurant, Khalid\u2019s Biriyani, KFC, Chambers, Carnival Ice Cream, Sponge, The Cake Factory and Hill Food Street; and Retail Supermarket including Softlogic Glomark.\n\nCommenting on the anniversary campaign, Amana Bank\u2019s Vice President \u2013 Retail Banking, Siddeeque Akbar said: \u201cCelebrating 15 years is a significant milestone for Amana Bank, and we wanted to mark this occasion by giving back to our customers in a meaningful way. Our 15 percent anniversary Debit Card promotion is designed to help customers enjoy greater value on their everyday purchases while encouraging smart and responsible spending through debit cards further complemented with our 15 day 15 percent cashback challenge\u201d."
