    "md5": "db16fc3affef4ad8e9a7bf9ed561ed2d",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1238,
    "chunk_text": "The dark side of using AI chatbots such as ChatGPT came to the limelight on August 15, when a\u00a0 Massachusetts teen was charged of the double murder of his mother and younger brother. Investigations revealed that the teen had used ChatGPT to search for \u2018theoretical ideas or fantasy stories\u2019 regarding the killing of his family.\n\nSri Lanka is currently experiencing an unusual spike in daylight robberies, shootings and so on. Investigators should perhaps look at the involvement of AI in these criminal activities. It is both ironic and scary to understand the fact that robots or non-humans are now commanding how to manipulate a criminal activity. A world without human thinking would be chaotic, stagnant and disconnected. Whether we are heading towards such a catastrophe is a question that remains.\n\n\u2018Your Thought\u2019 is a space, a right of the readers to support or contradict and discuss the issues highlighted in the editorial and other articles in the editorial and op-ed pages. Designed as the reader\u2019s editorial; our readers can send in their writings, with a word count not exceeding 200, to \u2018Your Thought\u2019, Daily Mirror Political Features Desk, No 8, Hunupitiya Cross Road, Colombo 2 or email to [email\u00a0protected]"
