    "description": "Telangana Boy Stabbed Principal 27 Times. How His Lavish Lifestyle Busted Him",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Telangana-Boy-Stabbed-Principal-27-Times-How-His-Lavish-Lifestyle-Busted-Him/108-348530",
