    "chunk_text": "The conference concluded with a panel discussion moderated by Numair Cassim and featuring Suren Rajakarier, Chaaminda Kumarasiri and Yasith Fernando. The discussion examined how intelligence and professional integrity enable internal audit to create strategic organisational impact.\n\nIIA Sri Lanka President Muzawwir Manzeer said the internal auditors must combine technological intelligence with professional integrity and sound judgement to create meaningful impact.\n\nIIA Sri Lanka continues to advance the profession through advocacy, training, networking, student engagement and globally recognised professional development, including pathways to the Certified Internal Auditor qualification. Through its collaboration with CA Sri Lanka, the eligible Chartered Accountants can also pursue the accelerated CIA Challenge Exam."
