    "chunk_size_bytes": 1947,
    "chunk_text": "Home Lands strikes Gold in digital space\n\nHome Lands Skyline has been recognised with two prestigious Gold awards at BestWeb.LK Awards 2026, winning Best Corporate Website - Gold Winner and the highly coveted Overall Best Website - Gold Winner.\n\nThe achievement marks a significant milestone for Home Lands, recognising the strength of its digital presence and its commitment to delivering world-class experiences both online and offline. This year\u2019s competition attracted 500+ applications, with 350 shortlisted and 106 awards presented across 24 categories.\n\nFor Home Lands, these awards represent more than recognition of its website. As Sri Lanka\u2019s number one, most trusted and most innovative real estate brand, establishing a strong digital identity has always been an important part of the brand\u2019s journey.\n\nThe Home Lands Skyline website has been developed as a comprehensive platform for the investors and prospective homeowners to explore the company\u2019s extensive portfolio, discover developments and access the information they need when considering a property investment.\n\nWith an intuitive layout, seamless navigation and visually engaging presentation, the website brings the scale, quality and lifestyle proposition of Home Lands to life digitally.\n\nWinning the Best Corporate Website - Gold is a meaningful recognition of how Home Lands represents itself as a leading corporate brand in the digital space. Securing the Overall Best Website - Gold Winner, selected from the winners across the competition\u2019s categories, makes the achievement even more significant and reinforces the strength of the platform as a whole.\n\nLK Domain Registry Chairman Indika De Zoysa said, \u201cThis is a celebration of the wonderful work that organisations, individuals and educational institutes have done to establish their presence on the web as well as all those who have chosen the .LK domain to build and establish their brands online.\u201d"
