    "description": "Port City Colombo welcomes high-level Omani delegation strengthening investment ties",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/Port-City-Colombo-welcomes-high-level-Omani-delegation-strengthening-investment-ties/215-348557",
    "lang": "en",
