    "chunk_text": "Namal grilled for six hours by FCID\n\nSri Lanka Podujana Peramuna (SLPP) MP Namal Rajapaksa yesterday left the Police Financial Crimes Investigation Division (FCID) after recording a statement for nearly six hours in connection with an ongoing investigation.\n\nRajapaksa arrived at the FCID in the morning following a summons and provided a statement to investigators before leaving the premises.\n\nDetails of the investigation were not disclosed in the information provided."
  },
  {
