    "md5": "157be2acf690aa8c160dd9fd93321ef9",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1571,
    "chunk_text": "360 Skin Clinic brings doctor-led care to Negombo\n\nDr. Sarah Fazy, Dr. Evanjana Silva with the 360 Skin Clinic Negombo staff\n\nA new chapter in aesthetic and cosmetic care has begun in Negombo with the opening of 360 Skin Clinic - Negombo, bringing its doctor-led approach to skin, hair and body treatments to the city.\n\nFounded and led by Dr. Sarah Fazy, Founder of 360 Skin Clinic and 360 Aesthetics, popularly known as Dr Cherry, 360 Skin Clinic is an ISO 9001:2015-certified cosmetic, medical, and aesthetic centre specialising in all skincare treatments. The Negombo opening marks the clinic\u2019s third branch as it celebrates five years in the industry, with plans for further expansion across Sri Lanka.\n\nLocated at 42 Chilaw Road, Negombo, the new branch occupies more than 4,000 square feet and has been designed as a modern, spacious destination that combines medical care, aesthetics, and wellness. The facility features more than 10 treatment rooms, dedicated therapy rooms and a Moroccan steam room. For Dr Sarah, the expansion is about more than establishing another location. It is about bringing professional, doctor-led aesthetic care closer to clients outside Colombo. \u201cIt is a very proud and special moment for me as we officially open our third 360 Skin Clinic branch. Having a location in Negombo has been a long-standing dream, and I am incredibly proud to see it become a reality. More importantly, this allows us to bring the standard of care we have established in Colombo closer to clients in Negombo and the surrounding areas,\u201d said Dr Sarah."
  },
