    "chunk_size_bytes": 1794,
    "chunk_text": "Waters Edge and Bellose Professional partner for lifestyle-driven brand activation\n\nWaters Edge recently collaborated with beauty innovator Bellose Professional to host a hybrid fashion and entertainment event, reflecting a strategic shift towards experiential brand activations in the local hospitality sector.\n\nThe Bellose Professional Hair Show, held on August 15 at the Extended Long Bar on the Edge, integrated runway artistry with live entertainment to enhance brand visibility and drive footfall for both the venue and its partners.\n\nThe collaboration aligns with the broader growth trajectory of Waters Edge under the strategic leadership of Chairman Chathura Krishantha Perera and General Manager Iyantha Abeysinghe. The property has focused on diversifying its revenue streams through high-profile strategic partnerships and expanding its comprehensive hospitality scope, positioning itself as a leading destination for premium lifestyle events that successfully merge commercial entertainment with industries like beauty and fashion.\n\nThis engagement also served as a strategic platform for Bellose Lanka, a fast-growing beauty enterprise that has expanded its footprint in the personal care segment. By partnering with Waters Edge, Bellose effectively showcased its modern beauty trends to a targeted demographic, highlighting the commercial viability of integrating local creative sectors into hospitality-driven marketing events.\n\nHighlighting these professional synergies, the evening featured a specialised showcase by veteran hairstylist Nayana Karunarathna of Salon Nayana. Karunarathna and her styling team presented contemporary, market-ready hair trends, while runway sequences were seamlessly coordinated by Rukmal Senanayaka\u2019s model academy and agency, Model with Ruki."
