    "chunk_size_bytes": 1424,
    "chunk_text": "Janashakthi Life concludes Shilpa Shakthi 2026\n\nJanashakthi Life has successfully concluded the 2026 edition of Shilpa Shakthi, its flagship educational initiative dedicated to supporting the grade five scholarship examination candidates.\n\nMarking the programme\u2019s 12th consecutive year, Shilpa Shakthi once again reinforces Janashakthi Life\u2019s long-standing commitment to empowering young learners through education and creating opportunities for academic success.\n\nConducted in collaboration with Derana FM, the 2026 programme reached students across key regions of Sri Lanka through a series of 12 educational seminars, successfully benefiting 6,568 grade five scholarship examination candidates.\n\nThe seminars provided the students with expert academic guidance, examination preparation techniques and motivation, helping them build the confidence and knowledge needed to excel in one of the most significant milestones of their educational journey.\n\nDesigned to bridge the educational disparities and improve access to quality learning opportunities, Shilpa Shakthi continues to support students regardless of their geographical location. The programme also recognised the important role parents play in a child\u2019s educational success by incorporating dedicated guidance and motivational sessions that equipped them with practical insights on supporting their children throughout the scholarship examination journey."
