    "description": "NCE to lead exporters\u2019 delegation to India to unlock new market opportunities",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/NCE-to-lead-exporters-delegation-to-India-to-unlock-new-market-opportunities/215-348646",
    "lang": "en",
