    "chunk_text": "Two arrested with over 1,044kg of cannabis\n\nColombo, Aug. 23 (Daily Mirror) - Two suspects have been arrested with more than 1,044 kilograms of cannabis during two separate raids in Gomagala.\n\nActing on a tip-off, officers from the Walana Central Anti-Corruption Strike Force conducted the raids.\n\nPolice seized 1,044 kilograms and 180 grams of cannabis along with a cannabis plantation containing 54,096 plants.\n\nThe suspects and the seized cannabis have been handed over to the Hambegamuwa Police Station, which is conducting further investigations."
