    "chunk_size_bytes": 1463,
    "chunk_text": "Commenting on the Bank\u2019s performance in the 2026 rankings, Sanath Manatunge, Managing Director/CEO of Commercial Bank said, \u201cReaffirming our position as the No. 1 bank brand in brand strength with a prestigious AAA rating, alongsidea substantial increase in brand value is a clear reflection of the strength, stability and trust that define Commercial Bank. These rankings reaffirm the enduring confidence placed in the Bank by our stakeholders and highlight the effectiveness of our long-term approach to brand building.\u201d\n\nBrand Finance evaluates brands based on internationally recognised standards, combining measures of brand value with a comprehensive assessment of brand strength through metrics such as marketing investment, stakeholder equity and business performance.\n\nPresent in 27 countries, Brand Finance is the world\u2019s first consultancy certified to provide ISO-compliant brand valuation and evaluation, and the first to produce reports compliant with both ISO 10668 and ISO 20671 standards.Founded in 1996, Brand Finance produces the annual Brand Finance Global 5000 brand valuation database.\n\nThe Bank has the highest capital base among all Sri Lankan banks, and is the largest private sector lender in Sri Lanka. Ranked No. 1 in the Business Today Top 40, Commercial Bank is recognised as the most respected and most-awarded bank in Sri Lanka, is a leader in digital innovation and is the country\u2019s first 100 percent carbon-neutral bank."
