    "md5": "b099f218dbe664b7b5a5d9982a5841d6",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1526,
    "chunk_text": "Richard Pieris Securities strengthens leadership\n\nRichard Pieris Securities (Pvt.) Ltd has strengthened its leadership to drive the growth of the business and continue delivering trusted and professional stockbroking services to the clients across Sri Lanka.\n\nThe company welcomed the key management personnel, who bring a wealth of experience in stockbroking and investment services. With the appointments now in place, the Colombo Stock Exchange has revoked the intended suspension of the trading activities of Richard Pieris Securities, enabling the stockbroking firm to resume its operations.\n\nThe strengthened leadership structure is anchored by the appointment of a new Chief Executive Officer for Richard Pieris Securities, supported by experienced professionals across the key management positions, further reinforcing the company\u2019s governance, regulatory compliance and commitment to delivering high standards of client service. With the company\u2019s unwavering commitment to continuing its full portfolio of services, the strengthened leadership of Richard Pieris Securities marks a new chapter in providing the clients with continuity and professional support in navigating Sri Lanka\u2019s capital market.\n\nThe company is supported by the Richard Pieris group (Arpico), one of Sri Lanka\u2019s long-established and respected diversified conglomerates, with 17,000 employees. This backing provides a strong foundation as Richard Pieris Securities moves forward with its renewed leadership and long-term growth ambitions."
