    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "d42845bfc4aba00ba5663a095f2a1876",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1993,
    "chunk_text": "SLASSCOM Xcellerate Accelerator empowers next-gen investment-ready tech start-ups\n\nThrough the SLASSCOM Xcellerate Accelerator, 21 high-potential start-ups have been transformed into investment-ready ventures, gaining the mentorship, strategic insights and industry expertise needed to scale and compete globally.\n\nAccording to the Startup Genome Global Startup Ecosystem Report 2026, Sri Lanka recorded the largest improvement among the emerging start-up ecosystems, climbing over 65 positions in the global rankings within a year. This progress highlights the growing strength of the country\u2019s entrepreneurial ecosystem, driven by collaboration among industry bodies, investors, development partners and innovation-focused organisations.\n\nThe SLASSCOM Xcellerate Accelerator supports Sri Lanka\u2019s emerging technology ecosystem by equipping start-ups with the knowledge, networks and capabilities to build scalable businesses, attract investment and compete globally.\n\nThe 2026 cohort features 21 selected tech start-ups across high-potential sectors, including AI and ML, edutech, healthtech, fintech, cleantech, agritech, enterprise tech, logistics, IoT, HR-tech, blockchain, cybersecurity and motion capture.\n\nThe programme focuses on strengthening investor readiness, business fundamentals, market readiness, value propositions and investment potential.\n\nDesigned as a hands-on accelerator, Xcellerate empowered the founders with the skills to refine business models, strengthen market positioning and prepare for investment through six specialised bootcamps covering ICP, start-up business models, investor expectations, pricing strategies, investor data rooms and fundraising readiness.\n\nSupported by expert-led sessions, mentorship and strategic guidance, the participating start-ups enhanced their customer validation, value propositions, scalability and investor engagement capabilities, gaining the knowledge and confidence needed to build sustainable, investment-ready ventures."
  },
