    "chunk_size_bytes": 1392,
    "chunk_text": "The company\u2019s management and employees have also played a key role in supporting its international expansion strategy. Gamma Interpharm is equipped with modern pharmaceutical manufacturing technology and advanced analytical capabilities, supported by a skilled workforce with international exposure.\n\nGamma Interpharm said its operations maintain a strong focus on the quality, safety and efficacy of its pharmaceutical products. The company views its entry into Cambodia as an important step towards building a stronger regional presence while demonstrating the potential of Sri Lanka\u2019s pharmaceutical manufacturing sector to compete in international markets.\n\nThe expansion is also aligned with Gamma Interpharm\u2019s vision, \u201cSeeking Excellence in contributing towards Quality Healthcare for All,\u201d reflecting its objective of making quality pharmaceutical products accessible beyond Sri Lanka. Gamma Interpharm is now preparing for further regional expansion, with plans underway to introduce its Sri Lankan-manufactured pharmaceuticals to Vietnam and the Philippines.\n\nThe company said the expansion into Cambodia, followed by its planned entry into additional Asian markets, would support its long-term objective of developing a globally recognised Sri Lankan pharmaceutical manufacturing enterprise while contributing to the growth of the country\u2019s pharmaceutical export sector."
  },
