    "description": "Is modernisation without ETA adequate to avert Sri Lanka\u2019s next forex calamity?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Is-modernisation-without-ETA-adequate-to-avert-Sri-Lanka-s-next-forex-calamity/4-796475",
