    "description": "Broader base, thinner yield: A compliance gap which requires a fix \u2014 what Sri Lanka\u2019s VAT statistics reveal",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Broader-base-thinner-yield-A-compliance-gap-which-requires-a-fix-what-Sri-Lanka-s-VAT-statistics-reveal/4-796484",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
