    "description": "Leaky bucket: Why widening  Sri Lanka\u2019s tax base is only half the battle",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Leaky-bucket-Why-widening-Sri-Lanka-s-tax-base-is-only-half-the-battle/4-796486",
