    "chunk_text": "Under Gotabaya Rajapaksa, the biggest ministerial portfolio change at the start of the first year, after the cabinet was formed, was a 18 departments change for the State Minister of National Security, Home Affairs and Disaster Management.\n\nThe periods considered were when the newly-elected presidents consolidated power in the parliament, following a general election, or being elected by parliament (for President Wickremesinghe). Accordingly, the time periods under consideration were: August 2020-August 2021; July 2022-July 2023; and November 2024-November 2025. The first year was selected as the period of analysis, as the current government has been in office for less than two years.\n\nMore details on the methodology and the Department Flow View can be accessed at www.opendata.lk website."
