    "description": "India\u2019s TCS to buy Porsche\u2019s IT unit, bags 5-year deal worth $1.46 billion",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Indias-TCS-to-buy-Porsches-IT-unit-bags-5-year-deal-worth-1-46-billion/108-348790",
