    "chunk_text": "Janashakthi Finance wins Silver at BestWeb.LK 2026 for Digital Excellence\n\nJanashakthi Finance PLC has been recognised with the Silver Award in the Best Finance & Insurance Website category at BestWeb.LK 2026, Sri Lanka\u2019s premier web competition.\n\nThe accolade recognises the company\u2019s continued focus on digital excellence, innovation, and creating more accessible, inclusive, and convenient digital experiences for its customers.\n\nThe recognition reflects Janashakthi Finance\u2019s ongoing investment in strengthening its digital capabilities and its commitment to elevating the way customers engage with the Company online. At the centre of this digital journey is its corporate website, which serves as a key digital touchpoint for customers, investors, and other stakeholders.\n\nDeveloped as part of Janashakthi Finance\u2019s broader digital transformation journey, the website was designed to reflect the company\u2019s refreshed brand identity while creating a modern, intuitive, and customer-centric experience. Built to accommodate modern customer expectations, the platform enables users to navigate information with ease, explore financial solutions, and connect with the Company through a seamless digital journey.\n\nThe website brings together Janashakthi Finance\u2019s portfolio of financial solutions, including Fixed Deposits, Leasing, Gold Loans, Savings, and Islamic Finance, alongside corporate information, career opportunities, branch details, and customer contact channels. With content available in Sinhala, Tamil, and English, and a responsive design across desktop and mobile devices, the platform is structured to make financial information and services more accessible to customers across Sri Lanka."
