    "chunk_size_bytes": 1758,
    "chunk_text": "People\u2019s Bank \u2018YES Infinity 2026\u2019 unveils exclusive lifestyle banking benefits\n\nPeople\u2019s Bank has marked International Youth Day 2026 by introducing a range of exclusive benefits under its \u2018YES Infinity 2026\u2019 programme, further strengthening its commitment to empowering Sri Lanka\u2019s youth with modern, convenient and rewarding banking solutions.\n\nDesigned to complement the dynamic lifestyles and aspirations of today\u2019s young generation, YES Infinity 2026 offers a host of lifestyle and financial benefits, including discounts of up to 40 percent at selected merchant outlets island wide, together with a special interest rate\u00a0 on People\u2019s Auto Loans and other exclusive privileges.The YES Infinity 2026 benefits are valid from 12 August 2026 to 30th September 2026.\n\nCommenting on the initiative, Deputy General Manager \u2013 Retail Banking of People\u2019s Bank, A.U.A. Anzar, said:\u201cPeople\u2019s Bank was founded in 1961 with the aim of bringing banking services closer to the general public. From its inception, the Bank has successfully introduced branded accounts tailored to customers of different age groups and professions, thereby making modern banking services more accessible to the people of Sri Lanka.\n\nIn 2003, to commemorate International Youth Day, People\u2019s Bank introduced the YES Account specifically to meet the needs of Sri Lanka\u2019s ambitious youth. Today, the YES Savings Account continues to evolve in line with the fast-paced lifestyles of young people, combining smart savings solutions with attractive financial benefits and digital convenience.\n\nAs we mark International Youth Day 2026, we are once again ready to offer a host of benefits to support the youth of Sri Lanka in achieving their dreams and aspirations."
