    "chunk_size_bytes": 1217,
    "chunk_text": "As the pioneers of flame-retardant cables in Sri Lanka, ACL had already been manufacturing FireGuard to this same standard of performance for more than 20 years before the SLS certification made it official.\n\nThe recognition ensures customers can visually identify certified fire\u2011safe cables, while reinforcing ACL\u2019s leadership in innovation, safety, and infrastructure reliability.\n\nCommenting on the landmark achievement, Suren Madanayake, Managing Director, ACL Cables PLC said, \u201cThe Purple Standard has always been our promise of safety and trust. With the SLS certification, the promise is now nationally validated. Customers now access cables which meet the highest standards of performance and reliability.\u201d\n\nWith the endorsement, ACL continues to lead Sri Lanka\u2019s cabling industry, aligning innovation with national standards and setting new benchmarks for safeguarding residential, commercial, and industrial applications.\n\nThe company continues to be committed to investing in engineering and technology to exceed evolving safety expectations and anticipating future standards, assuring Sri Lanka\u2019s infrastructure growth is supported by cables which embody responsibility, innovation, and trust."
