    "chunk_text": "Rajesh Chaturvedi, Co-founder and Chairman, Adfactors PR, said, \u201cWe have had the privilege ofserving India Inc. for the last 29 years through many cycles in the global and domestic business environment.I am happy that with this new partnership our relationship capital will expand to a significant market like Australia.\u201d\n\nAdfactors PR Lanka Founding Chief Executive Officer, Rezani Aziz said,\u201cWhen Adfactors PR first decided to expand outside of India, Sri Lanka was a natural fit. The intent then as now was to build a firm that serves as the gold standard to earned influence and reputation consulting, not just India Inc., but enterprises across Asia. This partnership is a milestone in that journey.For Sri Lankan companies, Australia represents an important market for apparel, tea and rubber, and a long-standing source of investment, education and community ties. Boards here are increasingly making decisions that play out in more than one market at a time, and reputation travels with trade. Being part of a group with depth in South Asia and now Australia, means our clients get counsel that understands how to grow reputation across borders.\u201d\n\nFor Adfactors PR, the investment represents a significant expansion of its presence and capabilities in the Asia Pacific region. For SenateSHJ, it provides access to scale and an international network while creating new opportunities to grow its own expertise, intellectual property and impact."
