    "md5": "3106559750942eb3e99218516533f5d9",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2016,
    "chunk_text": "OMODA & JAECOO records 144,841 global vehicle sales across June and July 2026\n\nHayleys Mobility, the mobility sector of Hayleys Fentons Limited and the exclusive authorised distributor for OMODA & JAECOO in Sri Lanka, celebrates the brand\u2019s continued global success, with 144,841 vehicles sold worldwide across June and July 2026, reflecting sustained international demand for its mobility portfolio.\n\nDriving this strong global performance was continued demand for New Energy Vehicles (NEVs), which accounted for 112,775 of the vehicles sold across the two-month period. The result reflects the growing appeal of OMODA & JAECOO\u2019s electric, hybrid and intelligent mobility technologies, while reinforcing the brand\u2019s expanding international footprint and alignment with the global transition towards smarter, more efficient mobility.\n\nCommenting on the performance, Hasith Prematillake, Managing Director of Hayleys Fentons Limited, stated:\u201cOMODA & JAECOO\u2019s sustained global performance reflects the growing customer preference for intelligent, efficient and future-ready mobility. As the exclusive authorised distributor in Sri Lanka, Hayleys Mobility is bringing this global innovation to local motorists with the confidence of trusted after-sales support, genuine parts and long-term ownership value. This aligns strongly with Hayleys Fentons\u2019 broader commitment to engineering-led innovation and sustainable progress.\u201d\n\nRoshani Dharmaratne, Executive Director of Hayleys Mobility Limited, added: \u201cThe strong performance across June and July, particularly within the NEV segment, demonstrates the pace at which the global automotive landscape is evolving.\n\nSri Lankan customers are increasingly seeking vehicles that bring together design, performance, safety, efficiency and intelligent technology. Through Hayleys Mobility, we are proud to offer access to this fast-growing global portfolio with the assurance of an authorised local partner that understands the needs of Sri Lankan motorists.\u201d"
  },
