    "md5": "0a82c251e70b7dd50a8be77527bf08d1",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1826,
    "chunk_text": "Green Lanka Towers eyes fresh capital with business expansion\n\nGreen Lanka Towers owned Green Lanka Property Developer (Pvt) Ltd (GLPL) has officially entered a new phase of growth defined by strategic equity restructuring, potential capital raising and portfolio expansion.\n\nThe company has solidified its balance sheet through capital optimization, securing 100 percent unencumbered equity in its flagship asset, Green Lanka Towers located on Nawam Mawatha, Colombo 02.\n\nAs part of its next phase of growth, the company is exploring new avenues of business expansion and evaluating opportunities to raise fresh capital, including through a potential investment partnership with Dato Sri Vijay Eswaran, Green Lanka Towers Managing Director Raju Radha highlighted recently.\n\n\u201cReal estate is no longer simply about bricks, buildings, and locations,\u201d stated Raju Radha, Managing Director of Green Lanka Property Developer. \u201cIt is about understanding what businesses need to become more successful and creating environments that support that ambition. Our journey has given us a deep understanding of shipping, property, businesses, and the importance of relationships. As we look ahead, we are taking steps to explore new avenues of expansion and raise fresh capital to position the company for its next phase of growth.\n\n\u201cI am also looking forward to exploring the possibility of raising new capital with my long-term business partner for over 25 years, Dato Sri Vijay Eswaran. Our partner Vijay has been a passionate and bullish investor in Sri Lanka because of his roots to Sri Lanka just like myself, and he entered this during some of the country\u2019s most challenging years. His connection to Sri Lanka and his origins in the country have shaped a deep conviction in its long-term potential.\u201d Raju Radha stressed."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
