    "description": "Govt.\u2019s Rs.95bn MSME,  agriculture credit programme nears exhaustion",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-main/Govt-s-Rs-95bn-MSME-agriculture-credit-programme-nears-exhaustion/245-348822",
    "lang": "en",
