    "chunk_text": "Sugeeshwara Bandara further remanded\n\nColombo, Aug. 25 (Daily Mirror) - The Colombo Fort Magistrate\u2019s Court today ordered former President Gotabaya Rajapaksa's former Private Secretary, Sugeeshwara Lenin Bandara, to be further remanded till September 09 over allegations of criminal misappropriation of funds allocated under the Presidential Expenditure Head."
