    "chunk_size_bytes": 1022,
    "chunk_text": "New service category for medical, dental specialists\n\nColombo, Aug. 25 (Daily Mirror) - The Cabinet of Ministers has approved the establishment of a new service category, \u201cSpecialist Medical and Specialist Dental Services,\u201d within the Sri Lankan health service.\n\nAt its meeting on January 12, 2026, the Cabinet approved the appointment of an Officers\u2019 Committee to make recommendations on establishing a separate service category for medical and dental specialists.\n\nThe committee has since completed a comprehensive review and submitted its recommendations.\n\nBased on the committee\u2019s report, the Cabinet approved a proposal by Health and Mass Media Minister to establish the new service category and appoint another Officers\u2019 Committee, chaired by the Secretary to the Ministry of Health and Mass Media, to draft the service constitution governing the new category.\n\nThe proposed service constitution is expected to set out the structure and applicable conditions for the specialist medical and dental services."
