    "chunk_size_bytes": 1254,
    "chunk_text": "In parallel, the Next Phase of the SDG Innovation Coalition was launched to accelerate measurable SDG progress by mobilizing innovation and private sector collaboration around national development priorities.\n\nThe leadership roundtable was further elevated by the participation of Prime Minister Dr. Harini Amarasuriya and Assistant Secretary General Sanda Ojiambo alongside C-suite participants from Sri Lanka and the wider region, reinforcing the critical connection between policy, investment and sustainable economic growth.\n\nForward Faster Now/ APAC 2026 demonstrated the UN Global Compact\u2019s unique ability to convene leaders across sectors and borders around a shared agenda for responsible business. By connecting global leadership with regional expertise and national action, the forum strengthened partnerships, elevated practical solutions and created new momentum for businesses to move forward faster on sustainability.\n\nAs Asia-Pacific continues to navigate complex environmental, social and economic challenges, Forward Faster Now | APAC 2026 leaves a clear legacy: sustainable development will be achieved not through isolated commitments, but through collective leadership, stronger partnerships and measurable business action at scale."
