    "chunk_text": "Occupying the ground and mezzanine levels, Thai Fusion delivers an authentic fine-dining experience led by a specialized team of gourmet chefs brought in from Thailand. With a seating capacity of 70, the venue offers an artfully crafted menu featuring traditional Thai salads, soups, fragrant curries, fresh seafood specialties, and signature desserts.\n\n\u201cWith Thai Fusion, we are particularly focused on maintaining authenticity, and following its establishment, we intend to expand the brand to other key locations around Sri Lanka,\u201d Afthab explained.\n\nThe opening of the twin-concept destination took place under the patronage of the Deputy Speaker of Parliament, Dr. Rizvie Salih, and Sarah Salih, alongside the participation of heads of diplomatic missions from Indonesia, Iran, Kazakhstan, Malaysia, Nepal, Pakistan, Palestine, T\u00fcrkiye, and Vietnam, together with business leaders and dignitaries.\n\nUniversal Gateway Holdings currently oversees a network of 11 branches across Sri Lanka and the Maldives. The portfolio is anchored by four Indian Summer restaurants situated in Colombo, Kandy, Nuwara Eliya, and Galle, as well as four Global Kitchen outlets and the flagship Thai Fusion venue. In the Maldives, the group operates both Indian Summer and Global Kitchen within a single integrated property.\n\nLooking ahead, the company is preparing to introduce a renowned Indonesian restaurant franchise to Colombo within the next six months to further diversify its expanding culinary portfolio."
