    "md5": "5289c63a4cd36e7bd3a26cfa23d4e851",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1328,
    "chunk_text": "Sathis Abeywickrama recognised as \u2018Flexo Avenger\u2019 at Asia Summit\n\nSathis Abeywickrama, Managing Director of Flexiprint (Pvt) Ltd, was recognized as a \u2018Flexo Avenger\u2019 at the Flexo Summit Asia 2026 held in Bengaluru, India, recently.\n\nThe \u2018Flexo Avenger\u2019 is a special recognition conferred on individuals who have made a significant impact on the development of Flexographic printing. He was featured and recognized at the Summit\u2019s \u201cFlexo Avengers: Converters who Changed the Game\u201d session alongside other leading personalities from the region.\n\n\u201cBeing recognized as a Flexo Avenger is indeed an honour, and it is also an acknowledgement and recognition of our continued commitment, innovation, and customer focus over a long but successful journey of over four decades. This journey has been marked by significant milestones and goes back to the time when specialized packaging required by our export industry, including tea bag tags and tags, were sourced from overseas,\u201d said Sathis Abeywickrama.\n\nHaving entered the printing industry in 1978 and established PrintUSA in 1989, Abeywickrama founded Flexiprint in 1994 to fulfill the requirement for Sri Lanka\u2019s important and booming tea export industry in terms of supplying tea bag tags, tea envelopes, tagged pyramid mesh tea bags and specialty labels."
