    "description": "Can ASUS crack the c-suite and state tenders amid influencer push?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Can-ASUS-crack-the-c-suite-and-state-tenders-amid-influencer-push/273-348870",
    "lang": "en",
