    "description": "Existential realism: Rethinking Sri Lanka\u2019s international relations in a de-globalising world",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Existential-realism-Rethinking-Sri-Lanka-s-international-relations-in-a-de-globalising-world/4-796518",
