    "chunk_text": "Dolly Parton dies\n\nWorld-renowned singer Dolly Parton has died at the age of 80, foreign media reported.\n\nDolly became popular for songs such as Islands in the Stream, which she sang together with the late Kenny Rogers, and Coat of Many Colors.\n\nThe country music icon sold more than 100 million records worldwide and wrote over 3,000 songs during a career that spanned six decades."
