    "description": "Legal action launched over illegal sand mining in Paranthan Proposed Reserve",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Legal-action-launched-over-illegal-sand-mining-in-Paranthan-Proposed-Reserve/108-348901",
