    "md5": "ddd2e8e731d58ce38bfb40d77c13a7a9",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 340,
    "chunk_text": "Yala National Park Blocks 1 and 2 to close temporarily\n\nColombo, Aug. 26 (Daily Mirror) - The Wildlife Department has announced that Blocks 1 and 2 of Yala National Park will be temporarily closed to the public from September 14 to October 15.\n\nThe department said the decision was made due to the prevailing drought conditions in the area."
