    "description": "Are Sri Lanka\u2019s wildlife laws enough to stop the destruction of medicinal plants?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Are-Sri-Lankas-wildlife-laws-enough-to-stop-the-destruction-of-medicinal-plants/108-348936",
    "lang": "en",
