    "md5": "fff277d1e7792e56a75aab845750bfb4",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1634,
    "chunk_text": "While the country is facing this plethora of mega problems, our politicians of the political opposition and the government, like the Roman Emperor \u2018Nero\u2019 of old, are fiddling while our country is sinking further and further into a mess.\n\nSadly no big campaigns have been launched to eradicate hunger malnutrition and anaemia in the country. Why is Lanka\u2019s Opposition trying to create a mountains out of a mole hill? How does the issue of increasing the retirement age of judges in our country compromise the independence of the judiciary?\n\nAnother question arises:\u00a0 Why has the Commonwealth Lawyers Association\u00a0 stridently raised its voice in support of their colleagues in the Lankan Bar Association. Some countries of the EU too,\u00a0 have taken up cudgels against the government\u2019s proposal.\u00a0 Even a UN Special Rapporteur has spoken out against government\u2019s plan.\n\nWhat a storm in a tea cup the government\u2019s proposal to increase the retirement age of Judges has created. Some analysts have noted that the controversy surrounding judicial independence could even become a rule-of-law compliance test under the EU\u2019s stricter GSP+ requirements.\n\nWow! All these international organisations taking up cudgels against this simple matter of the retirement age of judges in Lanka. In Gaza, the\u00a0 state of Israel is openly committing genocide against the Palestinian people. Since October 2023,\u00a0 Israel has kept up a relentless bombing campaign which has killed over 73,000 Palestinians. The UN reports over 21,000 Palestinian children have been killed in Israeli strikes. Another 44,000 children have been injured and maimed."
