    "md5": "0daba193191337af1585ca4e5eb21a21",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1496,
    "chunk_text": "Wow! All these international organisations taking up cudgels against this simple matter of the retirement age of judges in Lanka. In Gaza, the\u00a0 state of Israel is openly committing genocide against the Palestinian people. Since October 2023,\u00a0 Israel has kept up a relentless bombing campaign which has killed over 73,000 Palestinians. The UN reports over 21,000 Palestinian children have been killed in Israeli strikes. Another 44,000 children have been injured and maimed.\n\nIsrael has also launched attacks on Lebanon, Syria and Iraq and occupied parts of those countries too. In a similar manner,\u00a0 Israel together with the US has attacked Iran. It murdered over 140 children in their classrooms and killed the leader of that country.\n\nStrangely,\u00a0 neither these European countries nor the Commonwealth Lawyers Association have\u00a0 come out so strongly against the atrocities which are being carried out in plain sight in Palestine. Is\u00a0 this difference of attitude based on skin colour,\u00a0 or due to the fact the State of Israel is backed by the Israeli lobby in the US which \u2018helps\u2019 many Non-Government Organisations (NGOs).\n\nOr could it be these organisations, our parliamentary Opposition, particular political parties and NGOs in Lanka sincerely believe that extending the retirement age of Sri Lankan judges is more life-threatening than the genocide being committed in Gaza?\n\nIf not, why are we not all raising our voices to condemn Israeli genocide and support justice for Palestine?"
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
