    "chunk_size_bytes": 562,
    "chunk_text": "Three killed, including 10-day-old infant, in jeep\u2013three-wheeler collision\n\nColombo, August 27 (Daily Mirror) - Three people, including an infant, died in an accident this morning, involving a collision between a jeep and a three-wheeler in the Gonamariyawa area along the Kebithigollewa\u00a0 Medawachchiya main road.\n\nThe deceased are a grandmother residing in the Padaviya area, her daughter, and a 10-day-old infant child.\n\nPolice said the accident occurred while they were traveling to the Anuradhapura Teaching Hospital to get medical treatment for the baby."
