    "chunk_text": "Devotees observe Nikini Poya at Kelaniya\n\nDevotees offer prayers and participate in religious observances at the historic Kelaniya Rajamaha Viharaya on Nikini Poya Day in Kelaniya today (27). According to Buddhist tradition, the First Dhamma Sang\u0101yana (Buddhist Council) was held on Nikini Full Moon Poya Day, three months after the Buddha\u2019s passing, to preserve and perpetuate his teachings. It was also on this auspicious day that Ananda, the Buddha\u2019s chief attendant and guardian of the Dhamma, attained Arahantship. (Pix by Pradeep Pathirana)"
