    "chunk_text": "President pays homage to Sacred Tooth Relic\n\nColombo, August 27 (Daily Mirror) - President Anura Kumara Dissanayake, who is in Kandy to participate in the annual Esala Perahera celebrations, paid homage to the Sacred Tooth Relic at the historic Sri Dalada Maligawa this afternoon (27).\n\nDuring his visit, the President also met thousands of devotees who had gathered at the Temple of the Sacred Tooth Relic to witness the Perahera celebrations and inquired about their well-being.\n\nCentral Province Governor Dr. Harsha Suranga was also present on the occasion."
