    "md5": "091efc4e1f59b3c1ef5d287eae920346",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 632,
    "chunk_text": "Youth arrested for whipping pony near Lake Gregory\n\nColombo, Aug. 28 (Daily Mirror) - A 26-year-old man has been arrested by Nuwara Eliya Police for allegedly assaulting a pony used for tourist rides near Lake Gregory in Nuwara Eliya.\n\nPolice launched an investigation after a video circulated on social media showing a man allegedly subjecting a pony to an inhumane assault.\n\nThe ponies are commonly used for rides around Lake Gregory, a popular tourist attraction visited by both local and foreign tourists.\n\nThe suspect, a resident of Nuwara Eliya, is due to be produced before the Nuwara Eliya Magistrate\u2019s Court on August 28."
  },
