    "chunk_size_bytes": 395,
    "chunk_text": "Before-and-after Nepal floods\n\nCatastrophic flash floods along the Nepal-China border have killed at least 353 people and left more than 1,300 missing, sweeping away villages, roads and hydropower facilities. New satellite images from Vantor Satellite Imagery show the shocking devastation along a roughly 10-mile swath of the Trishuli River stretching south from the northern border with China."
