    "chunk_text": "Bribery Commission officers visit Ravi Karunanayake\u2019s residence\n\nColombo, August 29 (Daily Mirror) - Officers from the Commission to Investigate Allegations of Bribery or Corruption (CIABOC) visited the residence of MP Ravi Karunanayake today, but left after finding that the MP was not in Colombo.\n\nAccording to a close associate of Karunanayake, the MP had already left Colombo by the time the CIABOC officers arrived at his residence."
