    "md5": "7d567098d3ec9593c3c7af847d73b8e1",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 902,
    "chunk_text": "Underworld figure \u2018Welle Saranga\u2019 held in Dubai\n\nColombo, August 30 (Daily Mirror) - Underworld figure Saranga Pradeep, alias \u201cWelle Saranga,\u201d has reportedly been arrested in Dubai based on information provided by Sri Lanka\u2019s Central Crime Investigation Bureau (CCIB) and State Intelligence Service (SIS).\n\nAccording to reports, Dubai Police recently apprehended the suspect following information provided by the Director of the CCIB and intelligence officers who had travelled to Dubai in connection with efforts to locate and arrest Lalith Kannangara, alias \u201cBus Lalith.\u201d\n\nIt was reported that cocaine and crystal methamphetamine, commonly known as \u201cice,\u201d were allegedly found in the suspect\u2019s possession at the time of his arrest.\n\nHowever, Sri Lankan authorities have reportedly not yet received official notification from the relevant authorities in Dubai regarding the arrest."
