    "chunk_text": "Video dispute ends in death of 17-year-old student\n\nColombo, Aug. 30 (Daily Mirror) - A 17-year-old school student was killed in a sharp weapon attack in\u00a0 Eheliyagoda early this morning (30), police said.\n\nThe victim was an Advanced Level student at Eheliyagoda National School.\n\nAccording to preliminary investigations, the incident was linked to an argument that arose after another person allegedly recorded a video yesterday evening (29) near the Aarapola school junction, where a youth was seen talking to two young women.\n\nPolice said the suspect had gone to the student\u2019s residence early this morning and attacked him with a sharp weapon before fleeing the area.\n\nThe critically injured student was admitted to the Eheliyagoda Base Hospital but later succumbed to his injuries.\n\nEheliyagoda Police are conducting further investigations to arrest the suspect."
