    "chunk_text": "Ferry carrying 260 people capsizes off coast of northern Cyprus\n\nALJAZEERA - A search is underway off the coast of northern Cyprus after a ferry carrying around 260 people capsized, according to local media.\n\nThe catamaran-style vessel had left the port of Kyrenia, also known as Girne, and started sinking a few kilometres off the coast on Sunday."
