    "md5": "d81d3f3ed373fdd8a4c49ec3ae27cc91",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1578,
    "chunk_text": "Phoenix IT Lanka wins Check Point Best Performance  SMB Award again\n\nOrin Corporation Chief Technology Officer Thilina Madawala, \u2060 Check Point Distribution Manager Kiran Kukrimath, Check Point Sri Lanka and Maldives Country Manager Ashok Baddage, Phoenix IT Lanka Chief Executive Officer Sudarika Warakapola, Orin Corporation Sales Manager Shenali Samarasekara, Phoenix IT Lanka Managing Director Prabath Amila Perera, Check Point South India and Sri Lanka Sales Head Ganapathy Cheppudira and Check Point APAC Head of Sales Wei See Wong\n\nPhoenix IT Lanka (Pvt.) Ltd has strengthened its position in Sri Lanka\u2019s cybersecurity sector by securing the Check Point Best Performance SMB Winner 2026 award for the second consecutive year, marking another significant milestone in the company\u2019s five-year growth journey.\n\nThe recognition was presented at Check Point Award Night 2026, organised by South Asia Technologies (Pvt.) Ltd.\n\nEstablished five years ago with a vision to contribute meaningfully to Sri Lanka\u2019s technology and cybersecurity industry, Phoenix IT Lanka has evolved from a start-up into a trusted cybersecurity partner for businesses.\n\nThe company attributes its growth to a strong focus on customer trust, reliable cybersecurity solutions, technical expertise and long-term support.\n\nAs organisations face increasingly complex cyberthreats, technology risks and compliance requirements, Phoenix IT Lanka has positioned its services around helping businesses identify vulnerabilities, safeguard critical systems and strengthen their overall security posture."
  },
