    "md5": "c59ca74a2d34d283bcb26be7e272e53d",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1743,
    "chunk_text": "Evolution Auto brings Ather\u2019s Overtone series to Sri Lankan market\n\nEvolution Auto Pvt Ltd has launched the Ather Overtone series in Sri Lanka, bringing the premium electric scooter to local riders. The Overtone introduces two new features, Infinite Cruise and Magic Twist, alongside three colour options.\n\nThe Ather Overtone is built for riders who want performance without compromise. Infinite Cruise lets riders hold a set speed on longer stretches, while Magic Twist adds a new layer of control to the throttle response. Together, the features mark a step up for Ather\u2019s line-up in the Sri Lankan market.\n\nThe scooter is available in three colours: Space Grey, Lunar Grey and Still White. Each finish is designed to appeal to riders who see their scooter as an extension of their personal style, without straying from Ather\u2019s clean, minimal design language.\n\n\u201cAther has always been an inspirational brand, built on the belief that innovation should continually push boundaries and redefine what is possible. With our new series, we are taking that philosophy to an even higher level. The striking new designs are crafted to turn heads, while advanced features such as Infinite Cruiseand Magic Twist bring a new level of intelligence, convenience and sophistication to the riding experience, technologies traditionally associated with premium cars. More than just a new product, this series represents Ather\u2019s commitment to premium mobility: exceptional design, thoughtful technology and an uncompromising focus on the details that elevate every ride. We want every Ather to feel not just like an electric scooter, but like a truly premium product that people aspire to own.\u201d \u2013Zahran Ziyawudeen - CEO - Evolution Auto Pvt Ltd."
