    "md5": "7bba1b76714ef54b7d21c54f5fd6aeba",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1313,
    "chunk_text": "EthicalX launches 2026 cohort\n\nEthicalX: Climate & Innovation Hub, a global initiative of Clima Trust and SLYCAN Trust, has opened applications for its 2026 cohort and affiliate network, inviting entrepreneurs developing ethical, sustainable, and climate-friendly solutions to become part of a growing community of innovators and changemakers.\n\nAs interest in sustainable entrepreneurship continues to grow in Sri Lanka, many early-stage businesses within the entrepreneurship ecosystem continue to face challenges, including access to finance, mentorship, and guidance; inadequate professional networking opportunities; limited technical expertise; and restricted market opportunities.\n\nAddressing these challenges requires collaboration between entrepreneurs, the public sector, the private sector, and the wider innovation ecosystem while strengthening connections with policy processes and sustainable development.\n\nBuilding on experience and lessons learnt over the last cycles of cohorts and entrepreneurship support provision, EthicalX aims to provide the new cohort with a holistic package of support building on needs identified by entrepreneurs and stakeholders. This includes financial support for selected ventures, with support for lifestyle-focused entrepreneurs provided in partnership with c.fuge."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
