    "md5": "fb8fb372e4ef3107d4d3f4bcfb2492dc",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1948,
    "chunk_text": "The summit will feature an exciting lineup of regional and international speakers alongside Sri Lanka\u2019s leading industry experts, creating opportunities for learning, networking, and long-term collaboration.\n\nDMASL President Arjun Jeger shared his vision for this year\u2019s summit: \u201cDigital Summit Asia represents the next chapter of our ambition at DMASL. Over the past three years, we have built a strong platform in Sri Lanka, and now we want to connect our industry more meaningfully with the wider region. As Asia continues to shape the future of digital, technology and creativity, we believe Sri Lanka has an important role to play as a meeting point for global and regional ideas, talent and opportunity. Digital Summit Asia is our step towards making that ambition a reality.\u201d\n\nGayathri Seneviratne, Vice President and Summit Co-Chair, highlighted the summit\u2019s regional ambition: \u201cDigital Summit Asia 2026 is about creating meaningful connections that extend far beyond the event itself. By bringing together regional and global voices with Sri Lanka\u2019s vibrant digital community, we\u2019re building a platform where ideas, innovation, and partnerships can thrive while strengthening Sri Lanka\u2019s position as a destination for digital excellence.\u201d\n\nShalendra Mendis, Vice President and Summit Co-Chair, spoke about this year\u2019s vision: \u201cWe aim to deliver an experience that is both globally relevant and locally impactful. From internationally recognised speakers and cross-industry conversations to practical workshops and networking opportunities, our focus is on ensuring every delegate leaves with new perspectives, meaningful connections, and ideas they can apply immediately.\u201d\n\nOver two days, delegates can expect an immersive programme featuring globally recognised keynote speakers, regional thought leaders, technical breakout sessions, workshops, executive networking experiences, and interactive brand showcases."
  },
