    "description": "Sri Lanka\u2019s next farm crisis could begin with drought - and end with too much rain",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Sri-Lanka-s-next-farm-crisis-could-begin-with-drought-and-end-with-too-much-rain/4-796568",
