    "chunk_size_bytes": 710,
    "chunk_text": "Maithripala Sirisena honoured as \u2018President of the Happiest Era\u2019\n\nColombo, Aug. 31 (Daily Mirror) - Former President Maithripala Sirisena has been honoured with the title \u2018President of the Happiest Era\u2019 at a special international awards ceremony held at Temple Trees in Colombo.\n\nSirisena attended the ceremony as the chief guest, while Indian actor Garuda Ram, known for his role in the KGF film series, was among the international guests.\n\nThe ceremony, held on August 29 as part of the Global Brand Awards 2026 and SHE FOR THE NATION \u2013 Season 2, brought together business leaders, entrepreneurs, professionals, women leaders and representatives of international brands from Sri Lanka and overseas."
