    "chunk_text": "Meanwhile, Sri Lanka Police have stepped up international efforts to track down suspects who fled the country. A total of 66 fugitives have been repatriated to Sri Lanka from overseas, including 38 individuals wanted in connection with organized crime and other serious offences.\n\nA further 28 organized crime suspects have been brought back to Sri Lanka under INTERPOL Red Notices, according to police.\n\nPolice currently maintain 236 active INTERPOL Red Notices internationally. Of these, 96 target alleged organized crime syndicate leaders, while 93 additional notices are currently being processed as authorities work to secure the return of more fugitives to Sri Lanka."
