    "chunk_text": "Over Rs. 408 million earned from expressway traffic in one week\n\nColombo, Aug. 31 (Daily Mirror) - The Road Development Authority (RDA) has generated more than Rs. 408 million in revenue from vehicles using Sri Lanka\u2019s expressway network during the past week.\n\nAccording to the RDA, a total of 1,095,895 vehicles travelled on the Southern Expressway, Colombo Outer Circular Highway, Colombo\u2013Katunayake Expressway and Central Expressway between August 24 and 30."
