    "chunk_text": "The number of \u2060visible commodity vessels that sailed through the strait over the weekend dropped to five a day, shipping data showed on Monday, reflecting caution among companies wary of attacks on ships.\n\nU.S. Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent told Reuters on Sunday that the U.S. is likely to issue new secondary sanctions weekly on Iran.\n\nBrent and WTI are set to post small declines in August after falling more \u2060than 4% \u200blast week, in what was their first weekly decline in three.\n\nTrump \u200bsaid on Sunday that oil from a recently struck deal with Venezuela will be used to replenish the U.S. Strategic Petroleum Reserve, which has dropped \u200bnear its lowest level in 44 years."
