    "description": "Sri Lanka faces heightened Maha season risks from El Ni\u00f1o, high costs",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Sri-Lanka-faces-heightened-Maha-season-risks-from-El-Ni\u00f1o-high-costs/108-349153",
