    "chunk_text": "Suspected \u2018ICE\u2019 consignment discovered at Colombo Port\n\nColombo, August 31 (Daily Mirror) - A consignment of drugs suspected to be \u201cICE\u201d has been discovered inside a container at the Colombo Port, police said.\n\nThe suspected drugs were found concealed inside towels packed in the container, according to police.\n\nInitial investigations have revealed that the container had reportedly been brought into Sri Lanka from Pakistan.\n\nOfficers of the Central Crime Investigation Bureau are conducting further investigations into the discovery."
  },
