    "chunk_text": "\"Your Honour, my client currently has five stents. The medical reports relating to an examination conducted at a hospital in Singapore on August 26, 2026, state that there is a possibility of placing three more stents in the future. My client also suffers from sleep apnoea. He has also been infected with cellulitis, a serious bacterial infection, and therefore cannot stay in unhygienic environments.\u201d\n\nHe further submitted that Dr. Gotabhaya Ranasinghe had prescribed medication that his client was required to take daily and that he was also receiving insulin for diabetes.\n\nHe further told court that there was no reason for his client to evade the court proceedings and that several other cases involving him were also pending before higher courts.\n\nHaving considered the submissions, the Colombo Additional Magistrate ordered the release of former Minister Ravi Karunanayake on bail."
