    "chunk_text": "Recovery is not simply when reserves rise. It is when exports and productive industries continuously generate foreign exchange. Recovery is not simply when government revenue rises. It is when businesses grow, wages rise and prosperity naturally expands the tax base. Recovery is not simply when credit ratings improve. It is when global investors trust Sri Lanka enough to commit billions in long-term capital. Recovery is not simply when GDP returns to its pre-crisis size. It is when families regain purchasing power and businesses regain the confidence to invest, hire and expand.\n\nSri Lanka has won the first battle. It has restored stability against extraordinary odds.\n\nNow comes the harder battle: turning stability into recovery ie; investment, investment into production, production into exports, exports into foreign exchange, and economic growth into household prosperity.\n\nRecovery will restore prosperity. Transformation must ensure Sri Lanka never returns to 2022."
