    "chunk_text": "Two Pakistanis among three arrested over 463 kg \u2019Ice\u2019 haul\n\nColombo, August 31 (Daily Mirror) - Three more suspects, including two Pakistani nationals, have been arrested in connection with smuggling a massive stock of 'Ice' (crystal methamphetamine) hidden inside a container.\n\nThe arrests were made by the Central Crimes Investigation Bureau.\n\nAccording to the police, the operation follows the seizure of 463 kilograms of 'Ice' discovered during an inspection of the suspicious container."
