    "description": "CSE snaps three-month losing streak in August, down 5.7% YTD",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/CSE-snaps-three-month-losing-streak-in-August-down-5-7-YTD/34-796628",
    "lang": "en",
