    "date_str": "2026-09-01",
    "description": "Why Sri Lanka should not rush to change inflation target",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Why-Sri-Lanka-should-not-rush-to-change-inflation-target/4-796648",
    "lang": "en",
