    "chunk_text": "The wider disaster has become one of the deadliest Himalayan floods in recent years.\n\nFor relatives of the Muralitharan family, however, attention remains focused on finding the four missing family members.\n\nReports said the pilgrimage had been particularly important to Shylaja and that the family had spent considerable time preparing for the journey.\n\nThe family's Sri Lankan roots have also drawn attention from members of the Sri Lankan community at home and in Australia as the search continues.\n\nAustralian emergency personnel have been deployed to Nepal to assist consular and response operations, while officials are working with local authorities to account for missing citizens.\n\nAs rescue teams continue searching the devastated border region, the Muralitharan family remains among those whose whereabouts have not been confirmed."
