    "chunk_text": "Aloe Vera is widely recognized for its cosmetic and medicinal properties, with increasing consumer demand driven by its natural health benefits. The initiative supports the development of a consistent local supply of Aloe Vera in Sri Lanka while strengthening local agricultural production.\n\nThe harvested Aloe Vera is processed at the KIST fruit processing facility in Kilinochchi, the company\u2019s primary processing facility. The facility plays an important role in the local economy and is operated almost entirely by women, reflecting the company\u2019s commitment to empowering women and promoting inclusive development. The processed Aloe Vera is used in the production of KIST Aloe Vera Drink, ensuring value addition takes place locally while supporting rural farming communities. In addition to Aloe Vera, the facility processes locally grown fruits including mango, passion fruit and woodapple, which are used in KIST\u2019s fruit nectar and jam range."
