    "language": "en",
    "md5": "d0a421c384b88d6e4b18fa2ee3b49114",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1906,
    "chunk_text": "DIMO Agribusinesses strengthens \u2018Swaraj\u2019 customer support\n\nDIMO Agribusinesses, the sole authorized distributor for Swaraj tractors in Sri Lanka, recently concluded this year\u2019s \u201cSwaraj Parapura\u201d initiative, further strengthening its commitment to providing reliable after-sales support and an enhanced ownership experience to Swaraj tractor owners across the country.\n\nConducted for the fourth consecutive year, the programme focused on preparing customers and their tractors for the upcoming Maha cultivation season.\n\nThis year\u2019s \u201cSwaraj Parapura\u201d programme was conducted throughout July on an island-wide scale, covering regions across Sri Lanka where Swaraj customers are based and reaching Swaraj tractor owners across the country. Through the programme, DIMO Agri machinery service teams visited customers directly at their doorsteps, strengthening relationships with farming communities while making essential after-sales support more accessible.\n\nDuring the visits, the teams conducted free inspections of Swaraj tractors, together with minor repairs and servicing where required, helping customers ensure their machinery was in optimal condition ahead of the Maha season. Customers were also provided with practical maintenance guidance and advice aimed at improving tractor performance, durability and reliability while reducing potential downtime during critical farming periods. Complimentary gifts were also presented to customers as a gesture of appreciation for their continued trust in Swaraj.\n\nThe programme also created greater awareness among tractor owners regarding the availability of genuine Swaraj spare parts, and DIMO Agri Machinery\u2019s improved after-sales services. By taking technical expertise and support directly to farming communities, \u201cSwaraj Parapura\u201d continues to contribute towards a smoother and more reliable ownership journey for Swaraj customers."
  },
