    "chunk_text": "In addition, Pradeep Kahawalage serves on the Board of Directors of Ind-Expo Certification Limited and remains an active member of the PIM Alumni Association, continuing to shape industrial standards and economic growth across Sri Lanka.\n\nThe Ceylon National Chamber of Industries (CNCI) continues to play a pivotal role in shaping Sri Lanka\u2019s industrial landscape, remarked Jayasundara during her address at the gathering. Praising the pioneer chamber for bridging critical industry gaps and driving innovation and market expansion, she lauded its consistent support for economic development in recent years. Closing her remarks, Jayasundara extended her best wishes to CNCI Chairman Pradeep Kahawalage and newly elected office bearers for their endeavours."
