    "description": "Tepid progress in Sri Lanka on justice for past abuses alleges Human Rights Watch",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Tepid-progress-in-Sri-Lanka-on-justice-for-past-abuses-alleges-Human-Rights-Watch/56-796668",
    "lang": "en",
