    "md5": "30e60e243bce1f2fa5b7b59e66419902",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1915,
    "chunk_text": "The certification process involved a comprehensive review and strengthening of the company\u2019s operational systems. Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs) were established and enhanced, Good Manufacturing Practices were strengthened, HACCP principles were incorporated, and a risk-based approach was introduced across key operational processes.\n\nCommenting on the achievement, the management of Arctek Innovations said, \u201cAchieving these internationally recognised standards is a proud milestone for our organisation. It demonstrates the commitment, teamwork, and professionalism of every member of the Arctek family. More importantly, it reinforces our promise to provide safe, reliable, and high-quality adhesive solutions that our customers can trust. We view certification not as the finish line, but as the foundation for continuous improvement and sustainable growth.\u201d\n\nThe achievement comes at a time when the demand for reliable food-grade adhesive solutions continues to grow across food packaging and related manufacturing sectors. As manufacturers and packaging companies place increasing emphasis on product safety, traceability, regulatory compliance, and consistent quality, the adoption of internationally recognised management systems has become an important competitive advantage.\n\nArctek Innovations continues to invest in modern manufacturing practices, process improvements, employee development, and customer-focused innovation. The company believes that maintaining robust management systems will further strengthen its ability to serve both local and international markets while supporting compliance with applicable regulatory and industry requirements.\n\nThe implementation of ISO 9001, ISO 22000, GMP, and HACCP demonstrates Arctek Innovations\u2019 commitment to embedding quality and food safety into its day-to-day operations rather than treating certification as a standalone achievement."
